<h4 nodeId="03cc56e63745433a9c9d63568a78ebf1">(2) 具体实现：</h4>
<p nodeId="632327f56b304d27a2a6b978f5a1f1b8">以下只是帮助业务配置时，写的 Demo ，最终具体逻辑还待业务方自己拼写：</p>
<pre language="Java" nodeId="7e9ab9ed6e3d4d13a26df8b429981336"><code>##exp-5
let var_sum = seq.list(); // 要返回的字段定义要放在外层
let var_list = materials_tmp;
for var_x in var_list {
					 let var_Score = double(string.getJsonStringFromJsonMap(var_x,"imageForgeryScore"));
         
           let var_tmp = jsonString.search(string.getJsonStringFromJsonMap(var_x,"topSimilarity"),"similarity !=nil","similarity");
           let var_similarity = seq.get(sort(string.split(var_tmp,",")),0);
           
					seq.add(var_sum,var_similarity);
}
return var_sum;

代码说明：
##exp-5   //表示使用 Aviator5 语法
var_xxxx  //表示临时变量，不是参数，也不是因子</code></pre>
